Z||000000||Pheagey||11-11-2001||11:25 AM||||   I'll getting a '87 Grand Am torrow as a parts car. The owner tells me it has "the bigger of the two 4 cyclender engines" Would this be the quad four?<BR>Thanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||Kasdan||11-11-2001||12:32 PM||||I assume so, quad 4 came in many grand am's...maybe its the HO quad 4?  or was that the only quad 4?||||reg||1
Z||000002||PBJ||11-11-2001||12:38 PM||||the quad 4 is bigger in hp, but smaller in size, is 2.3L  <BR>the 4 tech is smaller in hp, like the fiero is 2.5L is "bigger in size"<BR>Didn't they also come with v6 (3300) and also a turbo 2.0?||||reg||1
Z||000003||Jake_2m4||11-11-2001||03:47 PM||||I think the older grand ams had 2 versions of the quad four in them.  The regular GA's had a regular quad four, and the GT grand ams had the HO quad.  There may have been an option to put the HO in the regular and the engines may have had diff internal volumes.  ie a 2.2 liter vs 2.3 liter, but I don't know.  Either way I think its a quad four.<BR>   Jake<P>P.S.<BR>Unless that year pre-dates quad four GAs?<P>------------------<BR>'85 Fiero SC<BR>'95 Grand Am SE<p>[This message has been edited by Jake_2m4 (edited 11-11-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||kyote||11-11-2001||07:57 PM||||I had a brand new '87 Grand Am.. the only 4 available was the 2.5.. it did have the DIS tho'..<BR>Quad 4 wasn't available till '88...<P><P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="blue">'84 SE</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">'84 SE (Strictly Parts Car)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">'86 SE</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">'00 HD 1200XL Sportster</FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000005||Jake_2m4||11-13-2001||01:08 AM||||Well then it appears it pre-dates the quad.  good to know.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Standard||11-13-2001||01:22 AM||||Yes, the quad didn't come out 'till 88.<P>All quad 4's are 2.3l.  LO has lower compression and different cams.  There's also a SOHC 2.3l that just, well, sucks.<P>[edit]<BR>oh yeah.. and stay away from '88 quad 4's.  Best years are 90-92.  Stay away from 95's, too.<P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">           <BR><FONT COLOR="red">1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed</FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="white">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by Standard (edited 11-13-2001).]||||reg||1
